{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.poster.avif?t=1770836277\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.webm?t=1770836277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/f657c940be7c456cb06f7682671c51d5.mp4?t=1770836277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bit Buddy</strong> reacts in real-time to your keyboard and mouse activity. Every click and movement brings an adorable response from your little companion. Even better, each interaction gives you a chance to unlock new decorations, with no extra effort required!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>600+ unique accessories and pet skins</strong> to collect and customize, you can give your Bit Buddy a one-of-a-kind look that matches your style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Buddy automatically logs your daily and historical keyboard and mouse activity, so you can easily track how much you\u2019ve typed or clicked.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working or studying, <strong>Bit Buddy</strong> stays by your side on your screen\u2014your loyal digital coworker, always there with you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcbb Instantly responds to your mouse and keyboard actions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/0479fa134156a4093b835405f0a75fdd.poster.avif?t=1770836277\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/0479fa134156a4093b835405f0a75fdd.webm?t=1770836277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/0479fa134156a4093b835405f0a75fdd.mp4?t=1770836277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf81 Each use of your keyboard or mouse may reward you with decorations, no extra steps needed!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/ead63c650eb372a28aeae666f8e6628a.poster.avif?t=1770836277\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/ead63c650eb372a28aeae666f8e6628a.webm?t=1770836277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/extras/ead63c650eb372a28aeae666f8e6628a.mp4?t=1770836277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally, want to see your character in <strong>Bit Buddy</strong>? Join our Discord and let\u2019s make it happen together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Privacy Policy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Buddy does not collect any of your device or personal information.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any keyboard or mouse usage data is stored locally on your own device and is never uploaded anywhere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other than the required communication with Steam (for things like purchase verification, achievements, or cloud save), the game does not perform any other network communication.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bit Beat 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874950/5738792f731213b542cbc779b5d45eb9a499329a.jpg"},{"name":"Bit Beat 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874950/cf19f7a2de596048af1a2fe1cdde9a93929adf13.jpg"},{"name":"Bit Beat 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874950/9436b11ee55604c9540033368a01ba93e12887db.jpg"},{"name":"Bit Beat 1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874950/25eb26e3572305cd77951e24fdebfc0281341fc2.jpg"},{"name":"Bit Beat 10000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874950/df3413afeb9ecc3bdfb54367257611682b6a12b0.jpg"},{"name":"Bit Beat 100000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874950/79704131c179bd2e45d0e794c5df175d929ce760.jpg"},{"name":"Bit Beat 1000000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874950/89dc8d4d99af78b79faedf6f153ae89ff8991274.jpg"},{"name":"Mouse Pressed 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874950/c5cbed26e519c069fdd3058f8ed3b5613b7ce27e.jpg"},{"name":"Mouse Pressed 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874950/23ab3289dce926a8a6ea0082dff50b102e7cbdea.jpg"},{"name":"Mouse Pressed 1000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3874950/a7221c7e7434246d3f3fc3faf7ecd2c0dce99d1f.jpg"}],"total":38},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874950?t=1770836277","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/53a37308f3